# Settings for the hosted Studio (sanity build / npm run deploy). Public: every
# SANITY_STUDIO_ value is compiled into the Studio, so never put a secret here.

# The site the Visual editor shows: the staging site, Vercel's stable alias
# for the `staging` branch, built from the staging dataset (the one the Studio
# edits), never production. The Studio writes your unpublished drafts into it
# live. (The public domain, www.stasiosdesign.com, is served elsewhere and
# refuses to be shown inside another site.) Change it when staging's address
# changes, add the new origin to Sanity's CORS origins, then deploy the
# Studio: npm run deploy.
SANITY_STUDIO_PREVIEW_ORIGIN=https://stasiosdesign-git-staging-stasiosdesign.vercel.app

# The live site (this repository's Vercel build, until the public domain moves to
# it): the publishing menu's links and the build stamp (/build.json)
SANITY_STUDIO_PRODUCTION_ORIGIN=https://stasiosdesign.vercel.app
